# Skyhook Mast (CIPlay skyhook_mast): the stack's top at 18 m (r~13 at 0 6) with the mast at 0 9 and the cabin x 4.5..9,
# z -1..3.5; the beach and the stack's foot at 1.5 m (x 0, z -44..-24) with the skylift at 0 -22.5; the wreck's shore at
# -12 -40, the wreck in the shallows south-west.
# 10-25 deep pass: after the zipline, the chart locker (-30 -62, in the lagoon) is tried without its key, then Gull Crag
# (36 18, 16 m; trail foot 36 3), Okafor's cave at 44 -24 (the key in her tool chest), then the locker.
island Skyhook Mast
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Mooring Mast
walk 0 -40 to 0 -32 h=1.5
zone stack_foot
expect step 1
read Mooring log
expect step 2
walk 0 -26 to 0 -12 blocked
use lift
wait 6
expect story liftride 1
expect step 3
expect height 18
zone mast_top
kill Screecher
expect step 4
walk 0 0 to 6.75 -2 to 6.75 1 h=18
open Mast cabin strongbox
expect story gear2 1
expect item ZiplineTool 1
expect step 5
use liftdown
wait 6
expect height 1.5
zone wreck_shore
expect step 6
open Albatross chart locker
expect message chart locker key
zone cragfoot
expect step 7
zone cragtop
expect step 8
read Station keeper Bram Holt
expect step 9
zone albatross_cave
expect step 10
read Nell Okafor's note
expect step 11
open Engineer's tool chest
wait 3
expect story chartkey 1
expect step 12
open Albatross chart locker
wait 2
expect done
